<title>UK: GRANDMET DISMISSES BID FOR BOLSWESSANEN.</title>
<headline>GRANDMET DISMISSES BID FOR BOLSWESSANEN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food and drinks group Grand Metropolitan dismissed on Tuesday as market speculation a report in Dutch daily newspaper Het Financieele Dagblad that it had launched a bid for Dutch group BolsWessanen .</p>
<p>&quot;This is market speciulation. GrandMet has ruled big acquisitions off the agenda to concentrate on the organic growth of our brands,&quot; said a company spokesman.</p>
</text>
